WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.160
John: Good morning, Hank.

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.160
It's Tuesday.

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.730
I'm on my way to get a tattoo.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.290
So Hank, I am here outside of Firefly Tattoo
with Rosianna, and I am going to get an inkless

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:12.480
tattoo as a punishment because apparently
in 2012, I did something punishable and then

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.799
you and Nerdfighteria dredged it up because
you like to see me suffer.

00:00:15.799 --> 00:00:19.460
Slightly off topic, Hank, but I just saw the
television program Firefly for the first time.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.460
It is excellent.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.680
Why did they cancel that?

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.880
So this is Laura, my tattoo artist.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.270
I have a couple questions.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:26.270
Laura: Sure.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.220
John: What is the least painful place to get
an inkless tattoo?

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.960
Laura: Anywhere that you've got some good
muscle.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.710
I know you've got some on your arm.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.193
John: My bicep is just huge muscles.

00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:34.193
Laura: There you go.

00:00:34.193 --> 00:00:38.940
John: Alright, I think I just want it to say
DFTBA on my, uh, on my upper arm.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.840
I actually brought a shirt to change into.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.250
Can you tell I am an anxious person?

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.250
Laura: Maybe just a little bit...

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.739
John: Are you just gonna... oh this is not
a tattoo this is a pen.

00:00:45.739 --> 00:00:47.910
Laura: This is a--this is a marker.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.310
John: Okay.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.461
Laura: Are you familiar?

00:00:50.461 --> 00:00:51.461
John: (laughing) Okay, yeah, I've seen those
before.

00:00:51.461 --> 00:00:54.480
But you know what I don't even want to look
at that.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.600
I'm scared.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.590
I'm going to be honest, Laura, that hurts
a little bit.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.289
Is it gonna hurt more than that?

00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:05.090
Am I the most anxious tattoo recipient you've
ever had in your career?

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:06.600
Laura: You might be, honestly.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:08.540
John: I'm honored.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.763
Laura: This is very strange not to have any
ink here...

00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:11.770
John: Okay, have you ever done an inkless
tattoo?

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:12.770
Laura: No.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:13.770
John: Oh sweet Jesus.

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:16.740
Laura: We're all trying new things today.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:17.740
John: Alright.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:20.610
Oh that doesn't hurt at all.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:21.610
Laura: I told you.

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:22.700
Hank, I think I might sort of like getting
tattoos.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.910
I feel like I could read a book while this
is happening.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:25.910
Laura: People do that.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:26.910
John: Do they really?

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.880
John (voice-over): So Hank, Laura made my
DFTBA tattoo with water instead of ink meaning

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.000
that it's gonna go away in about a month,
and I have to say that while I spent the last

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.120
several weeks fearing this punishment, it
turned out to be the least punishing Vlogbrothers

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.120
punishment ever.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:42.170
In fact, I really love the tattoo itself,
especially in all of its impermanence--I mean,

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:46.010
DFTBA are, after all, the five most important
letters in my life.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:50.090
Update: Just realized that both of my children
have five-letter names, so I would like to

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.040
amend my previous statement.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.600
But anyway, Laura made the whole process relaxing
and fun and pretty painless.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.740
We just chatted for a while and then suddenly--

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:58.740
Laura: That's also done.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:01:59.740
John: Are you serious?

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:00.740
Laura: That's it.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:01.740
John: It's over?

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:02.740
Laura: It's over.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:03.740
John: Hank, look at my awesome tattoo!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.650
Now I want to get a real tattoo.

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.132
Laura: See, I told you.

00:02:07.132 --> 00:02:08.300
John: I gotta talk to my wife though first.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:12.360
I can't believe it's over, that was so fast
and easy and relatively fun--I'm not saying

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.010
"get a tattoo," I'm just saying it's fast
and easy and fun--anyway Hank, as it says

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.250
on my arm, don't forget to be awesome.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:18.810
I'll see you on Friday.

